w artwork3.png", "id": "471767567345164", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974450_471767570678497_728062309251349919_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3ePn_Fw4gE0Q7kNvwFKHq72&_nc_oc=AdqPt1wTLqqDPvp6RIcLnGuSlDzymXGKV-JtdpocPNaUo_Goe-SmC-j2UyaKIHE6Uc4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEn6Apj0uwWi3fGUxlHUrsnds0KfmF8nU2vfIEcYPUflA&oe=6A917267"}, "display_name": "Alienation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Alienation, is an action-packed shooting game combined with sci-fi storytelling inspired by classic sci-fi action movies such as The Matrix, Equilibrium, and Ghost in the Shell. Alienation, puts you in the center of adrenaline rushed cinematic experiences. Each level comes with a different story, music-based gameplay, and a unique design to deliver a synchronized experience.\n- Go all in! Play all episodes back to back without interruptions!\n- Different play modes for different skills! Play harder and put yourself higher on the world leaderboard!\n- Find your very own style in shooting aliens and dodging the bullets! Flow with the rhythm in a music based arcade adventure!\n- Hardcore music! Hard rock, Industrial Electronics and of course Metal!\n- Go after achievements! Finish each episode to Unlock new achievements and new episodes!", "short_description": "Alienation, is an action-packed shooting game combined with sci-fi storytelling inspired by classic sci-fi action movies such as The Matrix, Equilibrium, and Ghost in the Shell. Alienation, puts you in the center of adrenaline rushed cinematic experiences. Each level comes with a different story, music-based gameplay, and a unique design to deliver a synchronized experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.51aliens.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.51aliens.com/terms-conditions/", "publisher_name": "51 Aliens LLC", "support_website_url": "https://www.51alien